00:56.471 --> 00:59.481
<b><i>Rebuilding City A{Putting City A back together} might be impossible.</i></b>

01:00.351 --> 01:04.361
<b><i>Well, right now I should focus{be focusing} on the battle.</i></b>

01:04.361 --> 01:09.401
<b><i>She may be rank 2 or whatever, 
but I can't leave it all to one little girl.</i></b>

01:09.401 --> 01:13.411
<b><i>I've got my own anti-aircraft measures.{anti-aircraft measures of my own.}{my own ways of fighting enemies in the air.}</i></b>

01:13.411 --> 01:14.581
<b><i>Like this!</i></b>

01:22.421 --> 01:23.291
<b>Hey!</b>

01:24.531 --> 01:25.911
<b>What do you think you're doing?</b>

01:27.041 --> 01:29.251
<b>This area's got some nice rubble.</b>

01:29.581 --> 01:32.001
<b>Hurry up and get out of my way.</b>

01:32.001 --> 01:34.301
<b><i>H-Her psychic power is this strong?!{She's using her psychic power?!}{E-Espers are this strong?!}</i></b>

01:34.791 --> 01:36.591
