01:46.971 --> 01:48.931
<b>We're under attack again!</b>

01:48.931 --> 01:50.231
<b>R-Return fire!</b>

01:50.231 --> 01:52.481
<b>The guns are wrecked{jacked}{all wrecked already}!</b>

01:52.481 --> 01:54.481
<b>Seriously?! We're dead meat!</b>

01:54.481 --> 01:56.361
<b>This planet's too tough!</b>

01:56.361 --> 01:58.611
<b>Lord Boros!</b>

01:58.611 --> 02:01.371
<b>I wanna go home…</b>

02:04.871 --> 02:07.001
<b><i>Such incredible power.</i></b>

02:07.581 --> 02:10.041
<b><i>Tatsumaki may actually bring it down on her own.</i></b>

02:10.661 --> 02:12.211
<b>I have errands to run.</b>

02:12.211 --> 02:14.001
<b>I will head out now.</b>

02:14.581 --> 02:17.091
<b>Things appear to be under control.</b>

02:17.091 --> 02:18.711
<b>Sure, go ahead.</b>

02:18.711 --> 02:20.971
<b>Some {heroes}of us have already left.</b>

02:21.671 --> 02:25.341
<b>Before I go, Genos, do you have a moment?{have you got a second?}</b>

02:25.341 --> 02:27.021
<b>There's something I wish to tell you.</b>

02:27.021 --> 02:30.481
<b><i>Class S rank 9, Drive Knight.</i></b>

02:30.481 --> 02:31.901
<b><i>{This is a first…}I don't think we're acquainted.</i></b>

02:33.231 --> 02:36.901
<b>Listen. Metal Knight is your {"}enemy.{"}{I have no idea what's going on with the quotation marks here.}</b>

02:37.771 --> 02:39.151
<b>Be careful.</b>

02:39.691 --> 02:40.901
<b>What do you mean?</b>

02:41.491 --> 02:42.651
<b>You'll know soon enough.</b>

02:43.151 --> 02:46.411
<b>But for now, keep your distance{stay away from him}.</b>

03:05.931 --> 03:06.931
<b>Bastard.</b>

03:06.931 --> 03:09.931
<b>You sure keep{make} things interesting.{concat with previous?}</b>

03:11.311 --> 03:13.431
<b>I'm beginning to taste victory.</b>

03:15.731 --> 03:17.441
<b>The stiffness in my shoulders is gone.</b>

03:17.441 --> 03:20.481
<b>Guess{But I suppose} I'm a little rusty.</b>

03:20.481 --> 03:21.981
<b>You're still ali—?</b>

03:21.981 --> 03:22.321
<b>Hey.</b>

03:23.491 --> 03:24.701
<b>Forgetting someone?{Forget something?}</b>

03:25.831 --> 03:28.711
Atomic Slash

03:25.831 --> 03:28.711
Atomic Slash

03:25.831 --> 03:28.711
Atomic Slash

03:25.831 --> 03:28.711
Atomic Slash

03:27.281 --> 03:29.581
<b>Atomic Slash!</b>

03:30.951 --> 03:32.331
<b>Insolence…</b>

03:32.701 --> 03:34.831
<b>Such utter{complete} insolence!</b>

03:35.581 --> 03:40.591
<b>You move your heart-thing inside your body to hide its location.</b>

03:40.591 --> 03:48.011
<b>But your regeneration always begins 
