03:53.141 --> 03:54.731
<b>See? Checkmate.</b>

03:54.731 --> 03:57.271
<b>No!{all versions of this I can think of bother me}</b>

04:01.271 --> 04:02.401
<b>Bang{-san}!</b>

04:02.821 --> 04:04.901
<b>All I needed was one more swing.</b>

04:05.281 --> 04:08.911
