06:29.171 --> 06:32.931
<b>but the outcome of this battle is clear.</b>

06:33.471 --> 06:38.561
<b>In the struggle to survive in our home world's harsh environment, my species came out on top.{My species won the struggle to survive in the harsh environment of our home world.}</b>

06:39.311 --> 06:42.941
<b>Our regenerative abilities are unmatched{second-to-none}.{We possess the ultimate in regenerative abilities.}</b>

06:42.941 --> 06:45.561
