07:11.761 --> 07:14.011
<b>Blah, blah, blah.</b>

07:14.011 --> 07:15.381
<b>Are you done?</b>

07:16.141 --> 07:17.181
<b>Is that all you've got?{With this?}</b>

07:23.181 --> 07:24.401
