07:33.651 --> 07:36.531
<b>Meteoric Burst!</b>

08:00.141 --> 08:03.931
<b><i>The energy shunted from my body transforms into a propelling force,{manga suggests that this should be italicized}</i></b>

08:05.181 --> 08:08.151
<b><i>elevating speed and power to 
a level beyond the limitations…</i></b>

08:10.071 --> 08:12.191
<b><i>of living flesh!</i></b>

09:07.161 --> 09:12.251
