<b>It's moving{listing}!</b>

09:28.641 --> 09:30.271
<b>You're doing it!</b>

09:30.271 --> 09:32.401
<b>Awesome, Tatsumaki!</b>

09:42.111 --> 09:42.911
<b>Oh.{lmao this line is awful to time, zang had it snapped to the keyframe and you could barely see it}{is it necessary?}{leaning SLIGHTLY towards yes}</b>

09:45.031 --> 09:46.331
<b>I made it!</b>

09:49.621 --> 09:51.001
<b><i>This man…</i></b>

09:53.131 --> 09:56.711
<b><i>makes me want to go all out!</i></b>

10:16.191 --> 10:17.941
<b>That's it{the way}, Saitama.</b>

10:18.571 --> 10:20.701
<b>You are indeed worth defeating!</b>

10:21.701 --> 10:23.951
<b>Consecutive Normal Punches.</b>

10:33.961 --> 10:36.421
<b>I <i>will</i> defeat you!</b>

10:39.131 --> 10:46.641
<b>All my energy will be released, 
blasting you and this planet to Hell!</b>

10:54.941 --> 10:58.941
<b>Collapsing Star, Roaring Cannon!{Planet Buster Roaring Cannon!}{hmmmmmm, opting to go with the flow of what's already established here}</b>

11:01.401 --> 11:04.281
