12:20.691 --> 12:23.481
<b>You were too strong…</b>

12:28.031 --> 12:29.531
<b>Saitama…</b>

12:34.711 --> 12:39.211
THE STRONGEST HERO

12:34.711 --> 12:39.211
THE STRONGEST HERO

12:34.711 --> 12:39.211
THE STRONGEST HERO

