14:12.131 --> 14:15.061
<b>How did City A end up like this?</b>

14:15.061 --> 14:18.811
<b>Class A, Rank 1 
 {*}Handsomely Masked{*Handsome Kamen} Amai Mask</b>

14:15.061 --> 14:18.811
<b>Class A, Rank 1 
 {*}Handsomely Masked{*Handsome Kamen} Amai Mask</b>

