19:32.831 --> 19:34.081
<b>Table tennis ball! Rice grain! Beanhead!</b>

19:32.831 --> 19:34.081
<b>Say something.</b>

19:34.081 --> 19:35.871
<b>Kettle! Baldy! Kneecap!</b>

19:34.081 --> 19:34.711
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

19:35.871 --> 19:37.091
<b>Listen, spoiled brat.</b>

19:37.631 --> 19:39.961
<b>Shut up and get lost, 
or get beat down.</b>

19:39.961 --> 19:40.751
<b>That's it! Yeah!</b>

19:43.881 --> 19:46.431
<b>Unforgivable. Me, a brat?</b>

19:46.431 --> 19:48.101
<b>I'm older than you!</b>

19:48.721 --> 19:49.891
<b>Genos?!</b>

19:49.891 --> 19:52.221
<b>You're next, B-class!</b>

19:52.221 --> 19:53.731
<b>{Cut it out}That's enough, Tatsumaki.</b>

19:54.521 --> 19:57.651
<b>Are you not a member{hero} of the Hero Association?{You're part of the Association— a hero, right?}</b>

19:59.901 --> 20:01.321
<b>Whatever.</b>

20:02.651 --> 20:06.821
<b>Why are the elite heroes all so difficult?{there so many troublemakers amongst the elite heroes?}</b>

20:06.821 --> 20:10.741
<b>Genos, your joints are all bent the wrong way.</b>

20:10.741 --> 20:12.661
<b>Here, I'll fix you up.</b>

20:12.661 --> 20:15.331
<b>Oh, sorry, your arm came off.</b>

20:15.331 --> 20:17.421
<b>My back is killing me.</b>

20:20.001 --> 20:23.181
<b><i>City A was wiped off the map that day.</i></b>

20:24.171 --> 20:27.301
<b><i>The arrival of aliens and City A’s annihilation</i></b>

20:27.301 --> 20:29.971
<b><i>were historic events, 
making the headlines{top stories} for days.</i></b>

20:30.601 --> 20:36.271
<b><i>But eventually, the coverage died down, and 
everyone forgot about{no one mentioned} the city that {had }disappeared.</i></b>

